OL,3,GNEWSATugs plan offers short-term
OL,4,Alifeline for Ferguson Marine shipyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ferguson Marine shipyard is to
OL,7,Fbuild a number of tugs while it awaits
OL,8,Fpromised orders from the Scottish
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FMinisters agreed to provide financial
OL,12,Fbacking for construction of the small
OL,13,Fvessels. The state-owned yard will then
OL,14,Ftry to find a buyer.
OL,16,FBBC Scotland understands that the Port
OL,17,FGlasgow firm will work with another
OL,18,Festablished shipbuilder, possibly the
OL,19,FDutch firm Damen, on a pre-packaged
OL,20,Fdesign, allowing the work to start
OL,21,Frelatively quickly.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
