OL,3,GNEWSATugs plan offers short-term
OL,4,Alifeline for Ferguson Marine shipyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement was criticised by
OL,7,Fopposition parties for being below
OL,8,Fexpectations, after the SNP made a
OL,9,Fpre-election pledge for four new
OL,10,Fvessels for the yard.
